# Portfolio template

- Sample identity is Dimah, from https://github.com/dimah-kz. It lives in `src/lib/site.ts`. Projects, docs, and posts live in `content/**/*.mdx`.
- Do not invent a biography, employer, location, or metric that is not already in `site.ts` or MDX.
- Interface labels come from `t` in `src/lib/i18n.ts`. Do not hardcode English in a component.
- Making the template yours means editing those files, not adding a parallel config.
- Guide: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)
